From e11729fe380f7ae5e007f21e4438fa087b4d7d95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mechanyaa-ai <mechanyaa@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 09:57:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] cps2w: the vsavjw catalogue entry re-pointed to merged-m26
 (14z-222)

jtframe's .rom builder locates every zip member by CRC32 and by nothing else
(mra2rom.go:163-172, no name fallback), so the machine entry must name the
CRCs of the actual build or the MRA produces no .rom at all. Regenerated from
build/m3b_merged34/rompath/vsavjw.zip by tools/gen_vsavjw_xml.py in the
consuming tree; --check now reports the catalogue matches the build.

EIGHT members moved, and they are the M26 member delta exactly (the consuming
tree's build/agent222/m26/member_delta.txt):
  vm3j.03d  91261273 -> d0efcb96   program: #363's freeze-reaction row
                                   (0x0238FA) and its jump (0x029CBA), and
                                   pointers into placed space relocated by
                                   #357's two new regions
  vm3j.04d  825d1807 -> c3df23e0   program: #357's guard-orb class row
                                   (0x080AF8), the orbs' motion operand
                                   (0x0D10E4) and pointer rows into placed
                                   space, relocated
  vm3j.07b  ec0ded7a -> 80051b2c   program: pointer rows into placed space,
                                   relocated
  vm3j.10b  e7e2cc04 -> 54d427d2   likewise
  vsw.41    4d35a3ce -> b021fe4f   wide extension: #357's watcher and motion
                                   table copies, #363's handler, and the
                                   placed regions after them, moved
  vsw.42    6a6d3439 -> 64a63edb   likewise
  vsw.33m   3cbf91c8 -> 85b53471   group-C glyphs, the M25 -> M26 mark
  vsw.37m   75b8f94d -> bd7680f5   likewise

No RTL, no cfg, no core change: doc/mame.xml only. cores/cps1, cores/cps2 and
cores/cps15 remain byte-untouched.
